<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n57488" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιννά̆μωμ-ον</span></b> , τό,
			= Hebr. <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>[kudot ]innamon</i>, a superior kind of <i>cassia,
				Cinnamomum Cassia</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				3.111
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>HP</u>
				9.5.1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PSI</u>
				6.628
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B.C.)</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>OGI</u>
				214.59
			</span></i> (Didyma, <span class="entity">iii B.C.</span>), etc.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῐνάμωμον</span></b> , <i><span class="en">
				D.P.
				945
			</span></i> (pl.), also in codd. of <i><span class="en">
				D.S.
				1.91
			</span></i>, v.l. in Hdt.l.c.; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κίνναμον</span>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> name of a fabulous Indian bird, said to make its nest of
			twigs of <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κιννάμωμον</span> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κινναμολόγος</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				616a6
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antig.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				43
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				2.34
			</span></i>.</div>
